        "factor": "House passage precedent",
        "direction": "up",
        "magnitude": "strong",
        "rationale": "H.R.33 passed the House by a wide margin, indicating strong bipartisan support that could lift odds if the Senate acts."
      },
      {
        "factor": "Senate companion introduced",
        "direction": "up",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "A Senate companion was introduced and referred, signaling momentum toward potential bicameral agreement."
      },
