    "synthesis_rationale": "The posterior probability (5%) is obtained by anchoring to the ~6% base-rate and applying explicit, directional updates for each factor. The magnitude of each update is weighed to reflect how likely each factor would shift enactment odds; the dominant drag comes from Senate inaction and gridlock, with House momentum and external negotiations providing upside. Calibrated to yield a low-but-nonzero posterior, acknowledging substantial uncertainty and the potential for late-stage movement."
  }
